      {
        "id": "l01",
        "text": "If you water a fern, where does it all go?",
        "at": 0.2,
        "speaker": "narrator"
      },
      {
        "id": "l02",
        "text": "The top soil soaks it up first.",
        "at": 3.7,
        "speaker": "narrator"
      },
      {
        "id": "l03",
        "text": "But only the roots can drink it.",
        "at": 6.6,
        "speaker": "narrator"
      },
      {
        "id": "l04",
        "text": "So the extra sinks through the gravel",
        "at": 9.6,
        "speaker": "narrator"
      },
      {
        "id": "l05",
        "text": "and drains into the saucer.",
        "at": 12.2,
